    {
      "path": [
        "damaging-factors"
      ],
      "source": "\r\n  TNT:\r\n    damage: yield * 2\r\n  ARROW:\r\n    normal:\r\n      damage: (0.1 * force) * max(1, weapon_enchant_power * 3)\r\n    INSTANT_DAMAGE:\r\n      damage: 7 * effect_lvl\r\n  POTION:\r\n    INSTANT_DAMAGE:\r\n      allowed-range: [ 5, 4, 5 ]\r\n      damage: 10 * effect_lvl\r\n  WIND_CHARGE:\r\n    damage: 20\r\n  TRIDENT:\r\n    damage: 1\r\n\r\n# Currently most structures cannot be \"broken\".\r\n",
      "comments": [
        "Currently the effects don't do anything for structures.",
        "Don't remove the following comment line:",
        "[Final]"
      ],
